ng", "id": "1696637708132244", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1696637714798910_4946681219789494925_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fpn9CIMNriwQ7kNvwFGUq_N&_nc_oc=Adoxrk8_pMxntWDucvQcTjnNSBl-IvZ80QlmGHV2GU9ltdpvh2QwuupDu6fCjBIQ6Jw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSATay_EljxN3SM_YN5RHs-TSlfdUcyPrObfOS9xkzqvQ&oe=6AFF1451"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "4383046621951627", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825462_4383046625284960_6704386613672609703_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P3Rot6JM9dAQ7kNvwHpZ0S7&_nc_oc=Ado9IpaOV9uUKyoqkfg4hYcpRNgaGS9kS6LPruziaRkaeA4XrWHdEwakZ1pYyy0KHxY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRATdO2MNF3-fH5GcDn9TA5cYHs48ILp4hX7_B1q-Tsig&oe=6AFF1B35"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "851768347981596", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825546_851768351314929_2053146473754133296_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uQfEDjGuQ9YQ7kNvwH8RdYT&_nc_oc=AdoqwEZLSNOsqoNo4gMtdL1Hp9DVsUF_5yaqu-vvQW2FcLIdANp6WnX0AgHlJ5NOaFM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRDzsziMuQIbsg2sCRfVyvoiE7Quvd9_y2kcxHxsbkCnw&oe=6AFF05C0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1632542594489813", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622285_1632542597823146_3689544893099760675_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5See8KY__QwQ7kNvwHIhOQH&_nc_oc=AdpgfmgPBcT0gPby7u-zxyUw2x3_nBkeVs4_H6528yFuJs-Qq_vWauyAvxeQaoMFWc8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS0O_7Wx4XU2PhtDDmS1lKd0iUMwUA8sqfXjMexprBOGg&oe=6AFF259D"}, "display_name": "Cortex Quest", "keywords": ["educational", "science", "biology", "ear", "psychology"], "long_description": "**WARNING:** This game must be played by at least 2 people. One player is immersed in VR, while their partner must have the Support File in hand: https://cortexquest.github.io/VR.\n# Train your brain. Become the system.\n\nStep into a VR experience where science meets gameplay. CORTEX QUEST is a collection of immersive mini-games for anyone ready to explore the mysteries of the human brain and sensory systems.\n\n# PSYCHOLOGY SIMULATIONS - Perception is not reality\n\nExperience neurological disorders and how perception can dramatically change.\n\nExplore three fascinating conditions:\n\n- Prosopagnosia - struggle to recognize faces and rely on alternative cues\n- Hemineglect - navigate a world where half of reality seems to disappear\n- Body Ownership Impairment - question what truly belongs to your own body\n\nEach simulation challenges your senses and shows how the brain constructs reality.\n\n# BIOLOGY ADVENTURE - HEAR WE GO!\n\nA scientific accident has changed everything\u2026 Your team of biologists has been miniaturized and sent inside the human body. Your mission: explore the auditory system and uncover how we perceive sound.\n\nEquipped with advanced VR tools, you will:\n\n- Dive into the cochlea and uncover its mechanics\n- Activate hair cells and observe how sound becomes signals\n- Manipulate sound frequencies to understand pitch perception\n- Trigger action potentials and follow neural pathways\n- Travel to the auditory cortex\n\nLearn hearing by doing, experimenting, and interacting.", "short_description": "CORTEX QUEST is an educational two-player VR experience where one player explores the brain and body, while a partner guides them through puzzles about perception, neurological disorders, and hearing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://novascience.github.io/VR/PrivacyPolicy/CortexQuestPrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dawson College", "support_website_url":